column2:
`0x6c54a0` (thiscall, `match_eng.cpp`) with the calls that touch things outside injected (`0x6d6f70` narrates, `0x6e1090` substitutes, the set pieces): the restart of play. 
 It zeroes the move state (`+0x1c5`, `+0x4782`.., `+0x8ea9`/`+0x8eaa`, `+0xf576`.., the pending move at `+0x475a`..) and, without `+0x1a8`: 
 - the 15 minutes since each side's last change (`+0x1d2`/`+0x1d4`; with `+0x8eb2` = 8, both and −1000 in `+0x476a`/`+0x476e`); 
 - after 60 minutes, 1 in 6, the first player out of stamina (`+0x4d` < 6750, `+0x10d` zeroed) is narrated (0x21cf); 
 - each side's mentality (`0x6df460` at `+0x9032` + 0xd0 × side): if it changed (or at the start) it is saved in `+0x1ab`, with the previous one; 
 - mentality 3/4 of the side with the ball (`+0x8eae`): random draw(10) of added time into `+0x8ed0` and half into `+0x8eb7`; the other side, in mentality 1, tires (`0x716450` with 1 + n/9); 
 - each side's AI substitution (`0x6e1090`; without a human, or a human with `+0x904b` outside a national team and without `0x5fd480`): minute > random draw(50) + 10 and 55 minutes of play since the last one, then `0x6bbb60` and `0x6bbf60`; 
 - near the end of each half (`+0x8ed4` = 495 or 990) the narration 0x21c1 with the added time; 
 - the tactics of each side (without a human) that changed mentality, by the marks `0x5b50d0` in the object at `+0x91e2` + 0x18e3 × side, according to the mentality (1 to 5), `+0xe`/`+0x13` of the manager (`+0x9051`), the formation (`+0x905d`: 3-4-3 and 3-5-2 Attacking are already attacking) and `+0x476a`; the narrations 0x2135 to 0x213d (`0x6ce310` decides 0x213b/0x213d), `0x6d10a0` and the cells' mark 0x400000 (`0x5b5290`); 
 - with `+0x8ebb` (narrated match), outside corners and penalties, and for free kicks only near goal (table `0xa15e44` >= 5): the crowd chants by score (`0x6ce310`), by the fixed clubs ([`0x9d0230`]..), by nation (`+0x76`: 4/12, 13, 14) or the "Ruud Gullit" one (`0x84b8b0`); 
 - and the set piece by `+0x8eb2`.
